OL,3,GNEWSAWelsh language commissioner
OL,4,Aresigns for 'personal reasons'
OL,5,
OL,6,FEfa Gruffudd Jones has resigned as
OL,7,FWelsh language commissioner for
OL,8,F"personal reasons", according to the
OL,9,FWelsh government.
OL,11,FIn a statement, First Minister Rhun ap
OL,12,FIorwerth said he had accepted her
OL,13,Fresignation and "I thank her for all
OL,14,Fher work".
OL,16,FGruffudd Jones was appointed at the end
OL,17,Fof 2022, taking up the post in January
OL,18,F2023 as successor to the late Aled
OL,19,FRoberts.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
