OL,3,GNEWSAWelsh language commissioner
OL,4,Aresigns for 'personal reasons'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt the time she described the job as a
OL,7,F"privilege", adding that her wish was
OL,8,Fto "see a Wales where people can enjoy
OL,9,Fusing the Welsh language every day".
